      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Melö mïlöy tïsï cho le pipö Lawi kareranpa koro Israel, nyinö kötösïköy ketö chane amörostin cho kïropchini ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kiy 18:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akï mönyorucha kor le werkökwa walaka, ECHOTYON nyo lïku kingarakatengwa kïrïp kegh nko ngölyontenyi nyo kimwochï chane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kïkany otini tötoy pich amörostin cho pö tïch anta kechir, ketöni tïsin löyö nko karenyakay kwodeny nko mutïn ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nko poretayi pagh nko dipay* nko mwaghpa arol nko puto kechir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo kikïl ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa pipö Lawi ompö ortïnekwa löwïr atökïpöghisyö ompö kaynata ECHOTYON kokay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ato ngwïna chi pö Lawi wölo kömöngöy ompö kanasyan anka tïkwïl nyo le nyengu ompö koro Israel, akengwïn nyinte ompö chamatenyi akïwö wölini kakïl ECHOTYON kesagha nyinte, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akany kïpöghisyö ompö kaynata ECHOTYON Tororötïnyi le werkökwa cho le Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otö nyinte omisyö nyo karkegh nko nyo pö tïsï walaka, kïsis cho nyoruno katangwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Taghata otöptino pipö punton",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nyini katakwa koronini konokwa ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa, motöp lö kïrïpöy otöptin cho ghach cho pö punton cho möngöy wöloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Motötö monekwo kïlïkwï amörostin, amopöghisyeghö ngorsyö anta chesoköynön anta ponintön, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 19:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.22.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuw 22:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anta put anta ngala oy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo ghöchini ECHOTYON chi nyo ighöy tïkwïn cho lata choni. Ngalechoni chini kegh ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa kïyona pïchoni tawunkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.48"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 5:48",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orip kegh tömonyorï kigheghchin ompö ECHOTYON.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kiyomisöto kingwïnata werkoyon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Terchini pïchoni opetekwa ochengöy korengwa pich cho le ngorï nko cho le chepsoköytin. Wölo melö chömwokwa ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa agha ngal cho lata choni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ist 3:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nyinö köteghöy lenyoni, kïyonwokwa nyinte werkoyon nyo karkegh nko ani, nyo ngwïno pikökwa kegh. Oterchï nyu ngalechi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Atanye kyotuyeghekwa kutïng pö Sinay, kyasaghakwa ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa lö, ‘Mekany kelïmacha kuti ECHOTYON Tororötïncha ngat anta kïsïwa ngat mayï wow atökïmeghö.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchanïn ECHOTYON, ‘Katep chane kïgh ompö ngöghomnyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyonchinan chane werkoyon nyo karkegh nko nyi nyo ngwïno pikökwa kegh, onetan nyinte ngal cho mwoghöy akïmwochini nyinte chane kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo omwochinan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.3.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ist 3:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwanka tïkwïl nyo mölïmönye ngalechan cho mwowu nyinte ompö kaynenyan, otepan chichoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo ato töp werkoyon anka tïkwïl ntökïlö ongölonöy ompö kaynenyan amelö komwochan nyinte kïngalan anta ngalana kaynata tororötine walaka, kïmeghöy werkoyontononi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Töptoy otepekwa kegh lö, kinkïtunecha lö ne ngölyon nyo melö kamwa ECHOTYON? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 18:22"
          },
